# The M19 demo, first boot (W19-S06): burrow logs in, is a user, cannot
# write /etc/passwd, makes a link in their home; su to root with root's
# password; root adds alice and gives her a password; both log out.
wait login: 
type burrow
key ret
wait Password:
type burrow
key ret
wait $ 
type id
key ret
wait uid=1000
type echo intruder >> /etc/passwd
key ret
wait Permission denied
type ln -s /etc/hostname name-link; readlink name-link; cat name-link
key ret
wait burrow
type su
key ret
wait Password:
type root
key ret
wait # 
type id
key ret
wait uid=0
type adduser -D alice
key ret
wait # 
type passwd alice
key ret
wait New password:
type alicepw
key ret
wait Retype
type alicepw
key ret
wait changed
type exit
key ret
wait $ 
type exit
key ret
wait burrow> 
type poweroff
key ret
